<p>Get the specified attribute from oCreature
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> GetCreaturePropertyType(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oCreature,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nProperty<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oCreature<dd>the creature whose property type is requested<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nProperty<dd>the property (stat) we want to know about
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Returns the selected property's type.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
