<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Gets the type of property for a given property index.
</p><p>The property types are: ATTRIBUTE, SIMPLE, DEPLETABLE and DERIVED. See <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/PROPERTY%20TYPE" title="PROPERTY TYPE *">PROPERTY TYPE_*</a>
</p>
